Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:44:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] EXEC-MU-ACCOUNTS fix round (track site): an explicit
 switch for log mode on a deployed site, the sender-off line at every
 switch-on start, the worker's default claim read when called

EDGE_EMAIL_LOG_ALLOWED=true (default false) is the only way to run the log email mode with the switch on outside
EDGE_ENVIRONMENT=local (ERRORS R2-26: a copied configuration never carries it by accident; a test of the live site
before its Resend key can), logged email_log_mode_allowed at every start. email_sender_off is logged whenever the switch
is on and no sender runs. Worker.claim reads the store's claim when called, so a store without one (a test double of
the dispatch) still builds a worker.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015yBxadqbqnpdpSwmfCDQca
